        "id": "fx-boundary",
        "label": "FX into Base",
        "focus": ["frankfurter", "fx", "transactions", "dashboard"],
        "note": "Frankfurter rates cache in fx_rate. PnL uses the Transaction date. Balances and Goals use the latest rate."
